      "body": "> Would slow down for other callers of _Py_FindSourceFile -- there are no other callers of _PyObject_CallMethodFormat than traceback.c itself.\n\nThen I assume that API was added with the intention that we'll use it somewhere else someday.\n\n> I think we can skip the entire loop actually, if open is NULL?\n\nYeah, that makes sense to me.",
